# Normalize all text files to LF in the repository and on checkout.
# Prevents CRLF/LF churn across contributors/OSes (e.g. the line-ending
# flip that dominated PR #31's diff). Corelight CBN parser configs and
# Google SecOps dashboard JSON are consumed as LF, so LF is canonical.
* text=auto eol=lf

# Binary assets: never normalize or diff as text.
*.png  binary
*.jpg  binary
*.jpeg binary
*.gif  binary
*.ico  binary
*.pdf  binary
*.zip  binary
*.gz   binary
*.tgz  binary
